# `device.register_window`

Register a launched window and mint its pid-bound, C2-capped session (operator-only; pid is kernel-attested).

**Policy** — command `[C3_CRITICAL]`. Capability `ship.space.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `space_id` | `string` |

## Returns

`RegisterWindowResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `session_token` | `string` |
| `actor_id` | `string` |
| `space_id` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call device.register_window --json '{ "space_id": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

